WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:05.301
Sign-off puts each person's timesheet and their invoice together.

2
00:00:05.551 --> 00:00:13.301
The order is set once per job. Here it's the camera HOD, then the PM, then you.

3
00:00:13.551 --> 00:00:17.302
Tap Approve both, and both are done.

4
00:00:17.552 --> 00:00:21.302
Or send it back with a note.

5
00:00:21.553 --> 00:00:29.703
On the crew side, each job shows one status, from submitted to paid.

